<view class="page {{largeText ? 'lt' : ''}}">

  <view class="segment">
    <view
      class="segment-item {{type === 'expense' ? 'segment-item-active' : ''}}"
      data-type="expense"
      bindtap="onTypeChange"
    >支出类别</view>
    <view
      class="segment-item {{type === 'income' ? 'segment-item-active' : ''}}"
      data-type="income"
      bindtap="onTypeChange"
    >收入类别</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="cat-head">
      <view class="card-title">{{type === 'expense' ? '支出类别' : '收入类别'}}</view>
      <view class="cat-reset" bindtap="onReset">恢复默认</view>
    </view>
    <view class="card-sub">共 {{list.length}} 个类别，点击右侧可重命名或删除</view>

    <view class="cat-list">
      <view class="cat-item" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="cat-color" style="background: {{item.color}}"></view>
        <view class="cat-name text-ellipsis">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="cat-tag tag tag-gray" wx:if="{{!item.builtin}}">自定义</view>
        <view class="cat-actions">
          <view class="cat-action" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" catchtap="onRename">重命名</view>
          <view class="cat-action cat-action-danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" catchtap="onRemove">删除</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="empty empty-sm" wx:if="{{list.length === 0}}">
        <view class="empty-text">暂无类别</view>
        <view class="empty-tip">在下方输入名称添加</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    说明：类别为全局共享，所有工程共用同一套。删除类别后，已有记录仍会保留原类别名称，统计数据不受影响。
  </view>

</view>

<view class="footer-bar {{largeText ? 'lt' : ''}}">
  <input
    class="add-input"
    placeholder="输入新类别名称"
    placeholder-class="form-placeholder"
    value="{{inputName}}"
    bindinput="onInputName"
    bindconfirm="onAdd"
    maxlength="10"
  />
  <button class="btn btn-primary add-btn" bindtap="onAdd">添加</button>
</view>
